          <choice_text>부채대자본비율</choice_text>
          <commentary>자본이 감소하므로 부채대자본비율은 영향을 받는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>매출액순이익률</choice_text>
