        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>총자산회전율</choice_text>
          <commentary>총자산이 감소하므로 총자산회전율은 영향을 받는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
